        "dependency_level": 12,
        "statement": "For an integer $n\\ge0$, $D=2^n$, and a normalized explicit amplitude table, [[alg-qc-state-preparation]] exactly prepares the target ray using at most $D-1$ prefix rotations and at most $D$ leaf phases. The specified Toffoli flag chain expands each operation into $O(n+1)$ bounded-arity gates using at most $\\max\\{n-1,0\\}$ reusable clean work bits, so the complete circuit has $O((n+1)D)$ gates and serial depth, in addition to the $n$ data qubits. For $n=0$, the ray is trivial and no gate is needed.",
        "justified_by": [],
